  "title": "Oppakning",
  "nav_label": "Oppakning",
  "description": "Stonetops oppakningsark: hvor mange ◇ du bærer med lett, normal og tung bør, lister over utstyr og små gjenstander, bruk av forsyninger, og hva Velstand gjør med kvaliteten på utstyret.",
  "sections": {
    "undefined": "Ubestemt",
    "gear": "Utstyr",
    "possessions-items-loot": "Eiendeler, gjenstander, bytte",
    "other-things": "Annet",
    "small-items": "Små gjenstander",
    "prosperity": "Velstand"
  },
  "body_html": "<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"inventory\">\n<p>Når du <strong><em>Utruster Deg</em></strong>, marker et antall ◇ nedenfor, på bestemte gjenstander eller Ubestemt.</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\">\n<li>For en <strong>lett bør</strong> (<em>rask &amp; stille</em>), marker opptil 3 ◇</li>\n<li>For en <strong>normal bør</strong>, marker 4-6 ◇</li>\n<li>For en <strong>tung bør</strong> (<em>bråkete, langsom, varm, trettende</em>), marker 7-9 ◇</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"undefined\">Ubestemt</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"inv-undef\"><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-0\" title=\"Markering 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-0\" aria-label=\"Markering 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-1\" title=\"Markering 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-1\" aria-label=\"Markering 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-2\" title=\"Markering 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-2\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-2\" aria-label=\"Markering 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-3\" title=\"Markering 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-3\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-3\" aria-label=\"Markering 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-4\" title=\"Markering 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-4\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-4\" aria-label=\"Markering 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-5\" title=\"Markering 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-5\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-5\" aria-label=\"Markering 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-6\" title=\"Markering 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-6\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-6\" aria-label=\"Markering 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-7\" title=\"Markering 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-7\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-7\" aria-label=\"Markering 8\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-8\" title=\"Markering 9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-8\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-8\" aria-label=\"Markering 9\"></label></span></div></div>\n<p>Når du <strong><em>Har Det Du Trenger</em></strong>, flytt en markering herfra til et bestemt ◇ nedenfor.</p>\n<h3 id=\"gear\">Utstyr</h3>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-supplies-0\"><span><strong>Forsyninger</strong> (4+Velstand bruk ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-more-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-more-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-more-supplies-0\"><span><strong>Flere forsyninger</strong> (4+Velstand bruk ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\"><span><strong>Enda flere forsyninger</strong> (4+Velstand bruk ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\"><em>Bruk forsyninger til å Komme til Krefter, Slå Leir eller ha ekstra <em>små</em> gjenstander.</em></p>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mess-kit-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mess-kit-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-mess-kit-0\"><span><strong>Kokekar</strong> (krever ild &amp; vann; får Forsyninger til å vare lenger)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-bedroll-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-bedroll-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-bedroll-0\"><span><strong>Skinnfell</strong> (gjenvinn 1d6 ekstra HP når du Slår Leir)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-blanket-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-blanket-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-blanket-0\"><span><strong>Teppe</strong> (<em>varm</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\"><span><strong>Skiftetøy</strong></span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-rope-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-rope-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-rope-0\"><span><strong>Tau</strong>, ~7,5 m</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shovel-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-shovel-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-shovel-0\"><span><strong>Spade</strong></span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sledge-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-sledge-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sledge-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-sledge-1\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-sledge-0\"><span><strong>Slede/båre/slepestell</strong>, kan rulles sammen</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\"><span><strong>Truger</strong></span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-torch-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-torch-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-torch-0\"><span><strong>Fakkel</strong> (varer ~1 time; <em>rekkevidde</em>, <em>område</em>, <em>farlig</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\"><span><strong>Oljelampe</strong> (○○○ timer, <em>tett</em>, <em>område</em>, <em>grov</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-extra-oil-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-extra-oil-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-extra-oil-0\"><span><strong>Ekstra olje</strong> (○○○○○ timer, til lampe/lykt, ubrukelig som våpen)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-firewood-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-firewood-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-firewood-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-firewood-1\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-firewood-0\"><span><strong>Ved</strong> (nok til en hel natt, <em>rekkevidde</em>, <em>område</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-hatchet-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-hatchet-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-hatchet-0\"><span><strong>Håndøks</strong>, jern (<em>hånd</em>, <em>kastevåpen</em>, x gjennomborende)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mallet-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mallet-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-mallet-0\"><span><strong>Klubbe</strong>, jern og/eller tre (<em>hånd</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mattock-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mattock-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-mattock-0\"><span><strong>Hakke</strong>, jern (<em>tett</em>, x gjennomborende, <em>grufull</em>, <em>uhåndterlig</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-maul-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-maul-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-maul-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-maul-1\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-maul-0\"><span><strong>Slegge</strong>, jern (<em>tett</em>, <em>voldsom</em>, <em>uhåndterlig</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-staff-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-staff-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-staff-0\"><span><strong>Stav</strong> (<em>tett</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-spear-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-spear-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-spear-0\"><span><strong>Spyd</strong>, jern (<em>tett</em>, <em>kastevåpen</em>, x gjennomborende)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-long-spear-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-long-spear-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-long-spear-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-long-spear-1\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-long-spear-0\"><span><strong>Langt spyd</strong>, jern (<em>rekkevidde</em>, x gjennomborende)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-bow-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-bow-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-bow-0\"><span><strong>Bue og jernpiler</strong> (<em>nær</em>, x gjennomborende, ○ få piler, ○ tomt for piler)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\"><span><strong>Ekstra piler</strong> (x gjennomborende, ○ rikelig med piler, ○ få piler, ○ tomt for piler)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-javelins-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-javelins-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-javelins-0\"><span><strong>Kastespyd</strong>, noen stykker, jern (<em>kastevåpen</em>, x gjennomborende, +1 skade, ○ tomt for spyd)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shield-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-shield-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shield-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-shield-1\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-shield-0\"><span><strong>Skjold</strong> (+1 rustning, +1 Beredskap på 7+ ved Forsvar)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-thick-hides-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-thick-hides-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-thick-hides-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-thick-hides-1\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-thick-hides-0\"><span><strong>Tykke skinn</strong> (1 rustning, <em>varm</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-cloak-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-cloak-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><label for=\"inv-cloak-0\"><span><strong>Kappe</strong> (<em>varm</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"possessions-items-loot\">Eiendeler, gjenstander, bytte</h3>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot0-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot0-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot0\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Gjenstand\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot1-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot1-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot1\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Gjenstand\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot2-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot2-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot2\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Gjenstand\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot3-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot3-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot3\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Gjenstand\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot4-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot4-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot4\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Gjenstand\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot5-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot5-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot5\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Gjenstand\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot6-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot6-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot6\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Gjenstand\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot7-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot7-0\" aria-label=\"Plass\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot7\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Gjenstand\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"other-things\">Annet</h3>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\">(dyr, verktøysett, lagrede ting osv.)</p>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:other-things\" rows=\"2\" aria-label=\"Annet\"></textarea></div>\n<h3 id=\"small-items\">Små gjenstander</h3>\n<p>Får plass i en lomme, pung eller støvel. Når du <strong><em>Utruster Deg</em></strong>, marker like mange ☐ nedenfor som 4+Velstand.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"inv-small-undef\"><span class=\"track-label\">Ubestemt</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-0\" title=\"Markering 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-0\" aria-label=\"Markering 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-1\" title=\"Markering 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-1\" aria-label=\"Markering 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-2\" title=\"Markering 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-2\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-2\" aria-label=\"Markering 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-3\" title=\"Markering 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-3\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-3\" aria-label=\"Markering 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-4\" title=\"Markering 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-4\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-4\" aria-label=\"Markering 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-5\" title=\"Markering 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-5\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-5\" aria-label=\"Markering 6\"></label></span></div></div>\n<p>Når du <strong><em>Har Det Du Trenger</em></strong>, flytt en markering herfra til gjenstander nedenfor, eller bruk forsyninger for å markere enda et ☐.</p>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list inv-small\">\n<li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-knife\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-knife\" data-check-id=\"inv-knife\"> <span><strong>Kniv eller dolk</strong>, jern (<em>hånd</em>)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-sling\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sling\" data-check-id=\"inv-sling\"> <span><strong>Slynge</strong> (<em>nær</em>, <em>omlading</em>, <em>uhåndterlig</em>, ○ få steiner, ○ tomt for steiner)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-rushlight\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-rushlight\" data-check-id=\"inv-rushlight\"> <span><strong>Sivlys</strong> (varer ~15-30 minutter, <em>hånd</em>, <em>grov</em>)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-tinderbox\"